T CELL STIMULATION TEST AND CYTOKINE
DETERMINATION

Blood samples were analysed for Tcell reactivity to GAD and IA-2 as previously described.”
To exclude interassay variability during follow
up, lymphocytes before and after therapy from
all patient visits were frozen and, after completion of the study, tested in one T cell proliferation assay. Cells were frozen in 50% FKS and
10% dimethylsulphoxide (DMSO) and stored
for 48 hours at —80YC and afterwards in liquid
