frozen cells for T cell reactivity to GAD and
JA-2 (data not shown). Results were expressed
as SI (SI=cpm peripheral blood lymphocytes in
the presence of antigen/cpm peripheral blood
lymphocytes in medium alone). All antigens
were tested in triplicate. Recombinant GAD65
was produced in a baculovirus system, purified
by immobilised metal affinity chromatography
on a chelate sepharose column (Elias,
Freiburg, Germany), and tested in concentrations of 0. 25, 0. 5, 2. 5, and 5 ug/ml. The
